This adaptation preserves the complete upstream role bodies and adds an
Instinct-specific interpretation before each body. It replaces host-specific
frontmatter with portable role metadata and supplies a role router, division
indexes, a catalog with source hashes, transfer instructions, and local build
scripts. The source revision and per-file provenance are in catalog.json.

Instinct is the product of its respective owner. This is an independent role
library, not an official Instinct integration or an upstream Agency Agents release.
